{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trigonometric Equations</strong> is a strict side-scrolling rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your mouse to adjust the graph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The triangle will move forwards while following the graph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/630761108b66826c18398aa8c79900f9.poster.avif?t=1770011152\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/630761108b66826c18398aa8c79900f9.webm?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/630761108b66826c18398aa8c79900f9.mp4?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press when the triangle meets the points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/1eda66c4f4ef5489ddd9945d2c407ae4.poster.avif?t=1770011152\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/1eda66c4f4ef5489ddd9945d2c407ae4.webm?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/1eda66c4f4ef5489ddd9945d2c407ae4.mp4?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and hold while the triangle passes through the curves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/39c46e07ee79a56b91cbf6a4b49591cc.poster.avif?t=1770011152\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/39c46e07ee79a56b91cbf6a4b49591cc.webm?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/39c46e07ee79a56b91cbf6a4b49591cc.mp4?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, don't press nor hold if the triangle is passing through dashed line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/94916a2fea7d82d411a0ce77a258e6a3.poster.avif?t=1770011152\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/94916a2fea7d82d411a0ce77a258e6a3.webm?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/94916a2fea7d82d411a0ce77a258e6a3.mp4?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the point has a hole inside it, don't press and let the triangle just pass through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/cc5a49d52511af2dc2518a9966d9a2f9.poster.avif?t=1770011152\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/cc5a49d52511af2dc2518a9966d9a2f9.webm?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/extras/cc5a49d52511af2dc2518a9966d9a2f9.mp4?t=1770011152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly up, down, left, or right and press in a perfect beat to prevent the triangle from crashing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique original soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and colorful levels to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very detailed level editor to make your own creative level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode for when you get stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic timing calibration for perfect sync between sounds and visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Get better at solving trigonometric equations</span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035290?t=1770011152","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035290?t=1770011152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/d6fb75f2d8d1675047d46a0de43a458192f6aad9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770011152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035290/d6fb75f2d8d1675047d46a0de43a458192f6aad9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770011152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trigonometric Equations</strong> is a strict side-scrolling rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your mouse to adjust the graph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The triangle will move forwards while following the graph.</p><p class=\"bb_